  Android-only words the shared module shows outside Compose: notification channels, the
  notification buttons and confirmations, and the system biometric prompt. These are Android
  string resources (read with context.getString), so unlike composeResources an apostrophe is
  escaped as \'. See AGENTS.md, "Strings and localization".
-->
